  #line-at(162.92pt, 696.56pt, " are known for their unique anisotropic properties and the ability to flow while ")
  #line-at(70.887pt, 711.12pt, "maintaining well-defined ordered structures. Each mesophase exists within specific temperature range ")
  #line-at(70.887pt, 725.66pt, "or within certain combination of temperature and concentration, depending on whether the LC is ")
  #line-at(70.887pt, 740.19pt, "thermotropic or lyotropic, respectively. LCs can respond to external signals, e.g. temperature")
