  #line-at(70.887pt, 737.24pt, "transitions, and temperature increases with the observation time and cumulative electron dose. ")
  #line-at(70.887pt, 751.777pt, "Thermal changes in LP-(S)TEM imaging in liquid samples are still poorly understood. The exact ")
  #line-at(70.887pt, 766.086pt, "temperature rise is still challenging to measure in such small volumes in the order of several ")
